### sb_attr_has_i_flag (U4.3 closure)

#### detects a trailing ' i' or ' I' case-insensitivity flag

- Verify: detects a trailing ' i' or ' I' case-insensitivity flag
   - Expected: sb_attr_has_i_flag("value i") is true
   - Expected: sb_attr_has_i_flag("value I") is true


